{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil Arial;}}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs26\b CLEAR_Login_Test_Case\b0\par\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs18\par\pard\plain\fs18\trowd\trgaph108\trleft-108\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\clbrdr\brdrs\brdrw10\cellx1500\cellx2700\cellx3800\cellx5000\cellx6200\cellx7600\cellx9000\cellx10000\cellx11000\cellx12200\pard\intbl\b Test Case ID\b0\cell\b Requirement\b0\cell\b Summary\b0\cell\b Preconditions\b0\cell\b Test Data\b0\cell\b Steps\b0\cell\b Expected Result\b0\cell\b Priority\b0\cell\b Test Type\b0\cell\b Status\b0\cell\row
\pard\intbl VWO-LOGIN-TC-001\cell Valid registered credentials allow login\cell Verify login with valid registered credentials\cell An active registered test account exists and the user is logged out\cell <registered_email>, <valid_password>\cell 1. Open https://app.vwo.com/. 2. Enter the registered email. 3. Enter the valid password. 4. Submit the login form.\cell Login succeeds and the authenticated dashboard opens.\cell High\cell Positive\cell Not Run\cell\row
\pard\intbl VWO-LOGIN-TC-002\cell Invalid credentials are rejected\cell Verify login is rejected with an incorrect password for a registered account\cell An active registered test account exists and the user is logged out\cell <registered_email>, <incorrect_password>\cell 1. Open https://app.vwo.com/. 2. Enter the registered email. 3. Enter an incorrect password. 4. Submit the login form.\cell Access is denied; the user remains on the login page or is rejected from accessing the authenticated dashboard.\cell High\cell Negative\cell Not Run\cell\row
\pard\intbl VWO-LOGIN-TC-003\cell Invalid credentials are rejected\cell Verify login is rejected with an unregistered email\cell A valid password is available; the email is not associated with any registered account\cell <unregistered_email>, <valid_password>\cell 1. Open https://app.vwo.com/. 2. Enter an unregistered email. 3. Enter a valid password. 4. Submit the login form.\cell Access is denied; the user is not granted access to the authenticated dashboard.\cell High\cell Negative\cell Not Run\cell\row
\pard\intbl VWO-LOGIN-TC-004\cell Email and password are mandatory\cell Verify login is blocked when both email and password are empty\cell The user is on the login page and not authenticated\cell <empty_email>, <empty_password>\cell 1. Open https://app.vwo.com/. 2. Leave the email field empty. 3. Leave the password field empty. 4. Submit the login form.\cell The form does not proceed to the authenticated dashboard; validation prevents submission or the user remains on the login page.\cell High\cell Negative\cell Not Run\cell\row
\pard\intbl VWO-LOGIN-TC-005\cell Email and password are mandatory\cell Verify login is blocked when email is empty and password is provided\cell The user is on the login page and not authenticated\cell <empty_email>, <valid_password>\cell 1. Open https://app.vwo.com/. 2. Leave the email field empty. 3. Enter a valid password. 4. Submit the login form.\cell The form does not proceed to the authenticated dashboard; email is required before submission.\cell High\cell Negative\cell Not Run\cell\row
\pard\intbl VWO-LOGIN-TC-006\cell Email and password are mandatory\cell Verify login is blocked when password is empty and email is provided\cell The user is on the login page and not authenticated\cell <registered_email>, <empty_password>\cell 1. Open https://app.vwo.com/. 2. Enter the registered email. 3. Leave the password field empty. 4. Submit the login form.\cell The form does not proceed to the authenticated dashboard; password is required before submission.\cell High\cell Negative\cell Not Run\cell\row
\pard\intbl VWO-LOGIN-TC-007\cell Valid registered credentials allow login\cell Verify login without using cached or previous session state\cell The user is logged out and no prior session is active\cell <registered_email>, <valid_password>\cell 1. Open https://app.vwo.com/. 2. Ensure the session is cleared or no user is authenticated. 3. Enter the registered email. 4. Enter the valid password. 5. Submit the login form.\cell Login succeeds and the authenticated dashboard opens in a clean session.\cell Medium\cell Positive\cell Not Run\cell\row
\pard\intbl VWO-LOGIN-TC-008\cell Successful login opens the authenticated dashboard\cell Verify the authenticated dashboard is visible after successful login\cell An active registered account exists and the user is logged out\cell <registered_email>, <valid_password>\cell 1. Open https://app.vwo.com/. 2. Enter the registered email. 3. Enter the valid password. 4. Submit the login form.\cell The authenticated dashboard becomes visible and the user is not redirected back to the login page.\cell High\cell Positive\cell Not Run\cell\row
\pard\intbl VWO-LOGIN-TC-009\cell Invalid credentials are rejected\cell Verify access is not granted when the credentials do not match a registered account\cell The user is on the login page and not authenticated\cell <registered_email>, <wrong_password>\cell 1. Open https://app.vwo.com/. 2. Enter the registered email. 3. Enter a credential combination that does not match the account. 4. Submit the login form.\cell Access is denied and the user does not gain access to the authenticated dashboard.\cell High\cell Negative\cell Not Run\cell\row
\pard\intbl VWO-LOGIN-TC-010\cell Valid registered credentials allow login\cell Verify access control before and after login\cell A registered account exists; the user is logged out before test start\cell <registered_email>, <valid_password>\cell 1. Open https://app.vwo.com/. 2. Attempt to access the authenticated dashboard before login. 3. Log in using valid credentials. 4. Re-check access to the authenticated dashboard.\cell Before login, access is not granted. After successful login, the authenticated dashboard is accessible.\cell High\cell Positive\cell Not Run\cell\row
\pard\plain\fs18\par\par\b Notes:\b0\par- This set of 10 test cases is based only on the supplied requirements.\par- Where a requirement is missing or ambiguous, the expected result is marked as \b Requires clarification\b0 .\par- No exact validation messages, password rules, or session rules were invented.\par\par\b Status:\b0 Not Run for all test cases.\par}\f0\fs18\par